1. Definitions

"Dataset" means the Fit4Men dataset, including its images, masks, annotations,
metadata, manifests, and any accompanying files distributed by the FitControler
project.

"Non-Commercial Purpose" means use for academic research, teaching, education,
benchmarking, evaluation, or personal study where the use is not intended to
generate commercial revenue or commercial advantage.

2. Permission

Subject to the conditions and restrictions below, permission is granted, free of
charge, to any person obtaining a copy of the Dataset to use, reproduce, study,
modify, and share the Dataset solely for a Non-Commercial Purpose.

3. Conditions

When sharing the Dataset or a substantial portion of it, you must:

- retain this license;
- retain the attribution to the FitControler project;
- include a link to https://github.com/tiny-smart/FitControler; and
- clearly identify any material modifications.

4. Commercial-use prohibition

You must not, without prior written permission from the project maintainers:

- use the Dataset, a substantial portion of it, or a derivative copy for a
  commercial product, commercial service, paid API, advertising, sale, rental,
  sublicensing, or other activity primarily intended for commercial advantage
  or monetary compensation;
- use the Dataset to train, fine-tune, evaluate, or validate a model or system
  that is offered as part of a commercial product or commercial service; or
- remove or obscure this commercial-use restriction.

This restriction does not prohibit publication of non-commercial research
results, provided that the Dataset itself and any restricted derivative files
are not distributed for commercial use.

